<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Fifty3 Design</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,300;9..144,400;9..144,500&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --crystal-white:#F5F4F1;
    --ink:#1B222A;
    --slate:#4C5B68;
    --pale-facet:#C4CDD3;
    --brass:#A9823F;
    --gold-line:#C9A455;
    --hairline: rgba(27,34,42,0.14);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background:var(--crystal-white);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Instrument Sans', sans-serif;
    font-weight:400;
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,.serif{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight:400;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;}
  .wrap{max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 48px;}

  /* facet motif — thin faceted lines, used once as the bold element */
  .facet-line{
    position:absolute; pointer-events:none;
  }

  /* recurring gold signature mark, used sparingly ahead of key headings */
  .gold-rule{
    width:40px; height:1px;
    background:var(--brass);
    margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .gold-rule.on-dark{background:var(--gold-line);}

  /* ---- nav ---- */
  header{
    position:relative; z-index:5;
    padding:36px 0 0;
  }
  nav{
    position:relative;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding-bottom:28px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline);
  }
  .wordmark{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size:22px;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
  }
  .wordmark span{color:var(--brass);}
  .nav-toggle{display:none;}
  .nav-burger{display:none; flex-direction:column; gap:5px; width:22px; cursor:pointer;}
  .nav-burger span{display:block; height:1px; background:var(--ink);}
  .nav-links{display:flex; gap:40px; font-size:15px; color:var(--slate);}
  .nav-links a{transition:color .2s ease; padding-bottom:2px; border-bottom:1px solid transparent;}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--ink); border-bottom-color:var(--brass);}

  /* ---- hero ---- */
  .hero{
    position:relative;
    padding:110px 0 120px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero .wrap{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap:72px;
    align-items:end;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(42px, 5.4vw, 74px);
    line-height:1.06;
    max-width:11.5ch;
  }
  .hero p.lede{
    margin-top:28px;
    max-width:38ch;
    font-size:17px;
    color:var(--slate);
  }
  .hero-photo{
    position:relative;
    aspect-ratio:4/5;
    border:1px solid var(--hairline);
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 0 26px, rgba(27,34,42,0.035) 26px 27px);
    display:flex; align-items:flex-end;
    padding:20px;
  }
  .photo-label{
    font-size:12.5px; color:var(--slate);
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
  }
  .hero-facets{
    position:absolute; top:-40px; right:-60px;
    width:340px; height:340px;
    z-index:-1;
    opacity:0.9;
  }

  /* ---- intro statement ---- */
  .statement{
    padding:100px 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--hairline);
  }
  .statement .wrap{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:0.4fr 1fr;
    gap:60px;
  }
  .statement .eyebrow-ref{ /* small structural label, not decorative caps */
    font-size:15px; color:var(--brass);
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-style:italic;
  }
  .statement h2{
    font-size:clamp(26px, 2.6vw, 36px);
    line-height:1.35;
    max-width:22ch;
  }

  /* ---- work grid ---- */
  .work{
    padding:40px 0 110px;
  }
  .work-head{
    display:flex; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:space-between;
    margin-bottom:52px;
    padding-bottom:24px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline);
  }
  .work-head .gold-rule{margin-bottom:14px;}
  .work-head h2{font-size:30px;}
  .work-head a{
    font-size:15px; color:var(--slate);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--slate);
    padding-bottom:2px;
  }
  .work-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap:28px;
  }
  .work-item{
    border:1px solid var(--hairline);
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 0 26px, rgba(27,34,42,0.03) 26px 27px);
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:flex-end;
    padding:18px;
    transition:border-color .2s ease;
  }
  .work-item:hover{border-color:var(--brass);}
  .work-item:nth-child(1){grid-column:span 4; aspect-ratio:16/10;}
  .work-item:nth-child(2){grid-column:span 2; aspect-ratio:3/4;}
  .work-item:nth-child(3){grid-column:span 2; aspect-ratio:3/4;}
  .work-item:nth-child(4){grid-column:span 4; aspect-ratio:16/9;}
  .work-item .title{font-family:'Fraunces', serif; font-size:18px; margin-top:6px; color:var(--ink);}

  /* ---- story ---- */
  .story{
    padding:120px 0;
    background:var(--ink);
    color:var(--crystal-white);
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .story .wrap{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.1fr;
    gap:72px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .story h2{
    color:var(--crystal-white);
    font-size:clamp(32px, 3.4vw, 46px);
    line-height:1.18;
  }
  .story p{
    margin-top:24px;
    max-width:44ch;
    color:var(--pale-facet);
    font-size:16.5px;
  }
  .story-cta{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    margin-top:36px;
    font-size:15px;
    color:var(--gold-line);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--gold-line);
    padding-bottom:4px;
    transition:opacity .2s ease;
  }
  .story-cta:hover{opacity:0.75;}
  .story-photo{
    aspect-ratio:1/1;
    border:1px solid rgba(245,244,241,0.18);
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 0 26px, rgba(245,244,241,0.035) 26px 27px);
    display:flex; align-items:flex-end; padding:20px;
  }
  .story-photo .photo-label{color:var(--pale-facet);}

  /* ---- testimonial ---- */
  .testimonial{
    padding:110px 0;
    text-align:left;
  }
  .testimonial .wrap{max-width:760px;}
  .testimonial p{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size:clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 30px);
    line-height:1.5;
    color:var(--ink);
    font-style:italic;
  }
  .testimonial .attrib{
    margin-top:24px;
    font-family:'Instrument Sans', sans-serif;
    font-style:normal;
    font-size:14px;
    color:var(--slate);
  }

  /* ---- footer ---- */
  footer{
    border-top:1px solid var(--hairline);
    padding:56px 0 48px;
  }
  .foot-rule{width:100%; height:0;}
  .foot-rule::before{content:""; display:block; width:40px; height:1px; background:var(--brass); margin-bottom:28px;}
  footer .wrap{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end;
    flex-wrap:wrap; gap:24px;
  }
  .foot-links{display:flex; gap:32px; font-size:14px; color:var(--slate);}
  .foot-meta{font-size:13px; color:var(--slate); opacity:0.8;}

  @media (max-width:860px){
    .wrap{padding:0 24px;}
    .hero .wrap, .statement .wrap, .story .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:36px;}
    .hero{padding:56px 0 56px;}
    .hero-facets{width:200px; height:200px; top:-20px; right:-40px;}
    .statement{padding:64px 0;}
    .work{padding:20px 0 72px;}
    .work-head{margin-bottom:36px;}
    .story{padding:72px 0;}
    .testimonial{padding:64px 0;}

    .nav-burger{display:flex;}
    .nav-links{
      display:none;
      position:absolute; top:calc(100% + 1px); left:0; right:0;
      flex-direction:column; gap:0;
      background:var(--crystal-white);
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline);
      padding:4px 24px 16px;
    }
    .nav-toggle:checked ~ .nav-links{display:flex;}
    .nav-links a{padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--hairline); border-bottom:none;}
    .nav-links a:hover{border-bottom:none;}

    .work-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:18px;}
    .work-item:nth-child(1),.work-item:nth-child(2),.work-item:nth-child(3),.work-item:nth-child(4){grid-column:span 2;}
    .hero-photo{aspect-ratio:4/3;}
  }

  @media (max-width:480px){
    .wrap{padding:0 20px;}
    .hero h1{max-width:none;}
    .work-head{flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:14px;}
    footer .wrap{flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start;}
    .foot-links{gap:22px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    html{scroll-behavior:auto;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav>
      <div class="wordmark">fifty<span>3</span> design</div>
      <input type="checkbox" id="nav-toggle" class="nav-toggle">
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#work">Work</a>
        <a href="#story">Our Story</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
      <label for="nav-toggle" class="nav-burger" aria-label="Open menu">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </label>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <svg class="hero-facets" viewBox="0 0 340 340" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <polygon points="170,10 300,90 260,230 90,240 40,110" fill="none" stroke="#C4CDD3" stroke-width="1"/>
    <polygon points="170,10 260,230 90,240" fill="none" stroke="#C9A455" stroke-width="1.25"/>
    <line x1="170" y1="10" x2="170" y2="340" stroke="#C4CDD3" stroke-width="1"/>
    <line x1="40" y1="110" x2="300" y2="90" stroke="#C9A455" stroke-width="1"/>
  </svg>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <div class="gold-rule"></div>
      <h1>Rooms considered<br>with quiet precision.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Fifty3 Design is a studio for spaces that reward a second look — restrained materials, exacting proportion, and light handled the way you'd handle glass.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-photo">
      <span class="photo-label">[ Photograph — hero interior, natural light ]</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="statement">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow-ref">A note on the work</div>
    <h2>We design the way good crystal is cut — every facet considered, nothing added for its own sake.</h2>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="work" id="work">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="work-head">
      <div>
        <div class="gold-rule"></div>
        <h2>Selected work</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="#">View the full portfolio</a>
    </div>
    <div class="work-grid">
      <div class="work-item">
        <span class="photo-label">[ Photograph — Project 01, living space ]</span>
        <div class="title">The Coppice House</div>
      </div>
      <div class="work-item">
        <span class="photo-label">[ Photograph — Project 02, detail ]</span>
        <div class="title">Merrion Row Studio</div>
      </div>
      <div class="work-item">
        <span class="photo-label">[ Photograph — Project 03, detail ]</span>
        <div class="title">Glasshouse Apartment</div>
      </div>
      <div class="work-item">
        <span class="photo-label">[ Photograph — Project 04, wide interior ]</span>
        <div class="title">The Long Room</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="story" id="story">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <div class="gold-rule on-dark"></div>
      <h2>Our story</h2>
      <p>Fifty3 Design began with a simple conviction: that a room, like a piece of crystal, is judged by how it holds the light. That idea has shaped every project since — from a single apartment to a full estate.</p>
      <a class="story-cta" href="#">Read our story</a>
    </div>
    <div class="story-photo">
      <span class="photo-label">[ Photograph — studio founder or workspace ]</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="testimonial">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p>"They understood, without being told, that the best luxury is the kind you have to look for."</p>
    <div class="attrib">— Private client, Dublin</div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer id="contact">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="foot-rule"></div>
    <div class="foot-meta">Fifty3 Design &nbsp;·&nbsp; Studio by appointment</div>
    <div class="foot-links">
      <a href="#">Our Story</a>
      <a href="mailto:studio@fifty3design.com">studio@fifty3design.com</a>
      <a href="#">Instagram</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
